# Flask Admin Favicon
# This is a placeholder for the favicon.ico file
# In production, this should be replaced with a proper 16x16, 32x32, and 48x48 pixel ICO file
# 
# The favicon represents a ticket/admin interface with:
# - Blue gradient background representing the primary brand color
# - White ticket shape with perforations
# - Simple line elements suggesting text/content
#
# To generate a proper favicon.ico from the SVG:
# 1. Use the favicon.svg file as source
# 2. Convert to ICO format with multiple sizes (16x16, 32x32, 48x48)
# 3. Tools: favicon.io, realfavicongenerator.net, or ImageMagick
#
# Example ImageMagick command:
# convert favicon.svg -resize 16x16 favicon-16.png
# convert favicon.svg -resize 32x32 favicon-32.png  
# convert favicon.svg -resize 48x48 favicon-48.png
# convert favicon-16.png favicon-32.png favicon-48.png favicon.ico